WEBVTT

00:07.310 --> 00:10.559
Happy Happy Girl! Happy Happy Girl!

00:10.560 --> 00:13.689
I wonder when it all happened?

00:13.690 --> 00:20.200
My chest is filled with
bits and pieces of you.

00:27.070 --> 00:30.499
What will I do? Now I'm
imagining us on a date.

00:30.500 --> 00:33.459
My heart is about to leap out.

00:33.460 --> 00:36.919
But even if I try to hide my embarrassment,

00:36.920 --> 00:39.179
I already know.

00:39.180 --> 00:47.180
My heart and thoughts
are directed towards you,

00:49.990 --> 00:53.440
I have fallen in love.

00:55.060 --> 00:58.469
Happy Happy Girl! Happy Happy Girl!

00:58.470 --> 01:01.609
Let me yell out.

01:01.610 --> 01:05.139
I want to embrace the same skies as you.

01:05.140 --> 01:08.239
Let's run and chase our dreams together.

01:08.240 --> 01:11.579
Candy Candy Love! Candy Candy Love!

01:11.580 --> 01:14.959
I might not know how to take the lead yet.

01:14.960 --> 01:21.419
But if I were to become
your pillar of support,

01:21.420 --> 01:24.970
can I keep on secretly loving you?

01:29.180 --> 01:31.185
IS SORA-CHAN'S
CHASTITY IN DANGER?!

01:29.180 --> 01:31.185
EPISODE NO. 5875

01:29.750 --> 01:32.550
Is Sora-chan's chastity in danger?

01:31.186 --> 01:33.190
A

01:34.120 --> 01:35.319
I'm Sora.

01:35.320 --> 01:38.689
I bet you're surprised to see me like this.

01:38.690 --> 01:41.190
Well, this is where I am.

01:41.550 --> 01:43.699
It's hard to explain how it happened.

01:43.700 --> 01:47.319
I was sorting out my clothes since morning.

01:47.320 --> 01:51.909
I couldn't bring myself to throw away
some cute ones that I've kind of outgrown.

01:51.910 --> 01:53.519
Then Miu showed up!

01:53.520 --> 01:58.639
Now that you're gone, Onee-chan's
currently lying around in her underwear!

01:58.640 --> 01:59.959
Miu!

01:59.960 --> 02:02.509
That was a call from Onii-chan.

02:02.510 --> 02:05.510
Oh yeah, you're working
overnight, aren't you?

02:05.970 --> 02:07.760
Miu!

02:08.320 --> 02:09.260
Hey.

02:09.261 --> 02:14.599
Since Onii-chan has to work overnight,
he asked Raika-san to come over.

02:14.600 --> 02:17.250
I told her that I wanted
to get back at Miu.

02:14.600 --> 02:17.969
I wanna get back at her, Raika-san!

02:17.970 --> 02:19.150
Very well.

02:20.350 --> 02:22.749
I've brought along two costumes.

02:22.750 --> 02:25.020
I will give you one of them.

02:25.990 --> 02:29.370
This is how Raika-san
imagined how it'd turn out.

02:35.630 --> 02:40.219
I did my best to sit still in my costume
behind those closed doors, but...

02:40.220 --> 02:43.299
Onee-chan? Raika-san?

02:43.300 --> 02:46.189
Huh, that's bizarre.

02:46.190 --> 02:47.380
Coming!

02:54.030 --> 02:55.479
Shiori-san!

02:55.480 --> 02:59.959
Uh, the thing is I borrowed a
horror DVD from a friend.

02:59.960 --> 03:01.979
But I'm too scared to watch it alone.

03:01.980 --> 03:04.839
I was wondering if someone
can watch it with me.

03:04.840 --> 03:06.859
Is Yuuta-san maybe around?

03:06.860 --> 03:09.239
Sorry, he's at work.

03:09.240 --> 03:12.569
My sister and Raika-san must've
gone somewhere too.

03:12.570 --> 03:14.750
Can I come watch it with you?

03:15.580 --> 03:16.990
Hina!

03:21.230 --> 03:22.540
Lucky.

03:23.610 --> 03:28.899
It got too hot inside the
closet, and here we are now.

03:28.900 --> 03:30.580
This is so stupid.

03:41.560 --> 03:43.189
Rejoice, Sora-chan,

03:43.190 --> 03:50.069
for after several minutes of deep thinking, I
have found the best solution to our problem.

03:50.070 --> 03:53.909
That's great. What's the solution?

03:53.910 --> 03:56.039
We break the duster
with our brute strength.

03:56.040 --> 03:57.700
Wait!

03:58.600 --> 04:01.329
Yuri-san gave me that duster.

04:01.330 --> 04:03.489
<i>Give it a twirl...</i>

04:03.490 --> 04:05.340
<i>then give it two shakes!</i>

04:06.080 --> 04:07.840
<i>I wanna try!</i>

04:08.230 --> 04:09.230
<i>Here.</i>

04:11.760 --> 04:13.850
So if there's any other way...

04:14.460 --> 04:16.450
Okay, let's change plans.

04:17.820 --> 04:22.110
We wrap some sort of string
around the duster and lift...

04:24.800 --> 04:25.819
Well?

04:25.820 --> 04:28.989
But where will we find a string?

04:28.990 --> 04:30.490
Do not worry.

04:35.220 --> 04:37.949
The top part is a little bit more open.

04:37.950 --> 04:41.749
Then you grab the string as it swings back.

04:41.750 --> 04:43.849
Then we lift, got it?

04:43.850 --> 04:45.630
Target sighted.

04:47.780 --> 04:49.919
Here we go.

04:49.920 --> 04:50.920
Now.

04:51.380 --> 04:52.380
Ow.

04:58.590 --> 04:59.810
We failed.

05:00.630 --> 05:01.630
Sora-chan?

05:05.440 --> 05:07.369
Here we go!

05:07.370 --> 05:07.980
Ow!

05:07.981 --> 05:10.790
Higher and higher!

05:14.330 --> 05:16.620
So, what will we do now?

05:17.000 --> 05:18.090
Right...

05:20.950 --> 05:23.460
They really <i>are</i> big.

05:24.460 --> 05:26.330
Sorry!

05:27.180 --> 05:31.380
I'm sorry. I can't maintain
this posture much longer.

05:33.030 --> 05:35.720
Sora-chan, have you ever been kissed?

05:36.590 --> 05:37.959
No.

05:37.960 --> 05:42.070
Then I won't be the one
to steal your first kiss.

05:42.980 --> 05:44.640
But...

05:45.880 --> 05:48.020
She's... <i>this</i> close.

05:49.040 --> 05:50.330
I'm home!

05:52.590 --> 05:53.610
Huh?

05:58.710 --> 06:00.719
Where are you guys?

06:00.720 --> 06:04.710
I did two extra workloads
just to avoid an overnight shift.

06:05.710 --> 06:06.710
No...

06:06.711 --> 06:09.119
Our breasts are rubbing together.

06:09.120 --> 06:11.119
It feels weird.

06:11.120 --> 06:13.529
What's going to happen to me?

06:13.530 --> 06:16.720
Is Raika-san going to end up being...

06:17.720 --> 06:19.930
my first?

06:21.250 --> 06:22.720
Eureka.

06:30.230 --> 06:32.850
Sora-chan? Raika-san?

06:41.580 --> 06:42.870
Success.

06:44.380 --> 06:46.540
Why are you two naked?!

06:58.420 --> 06:59.420
Onii-chan!

06:59.690 --> 07:00.640
Onii-chan!

07:00.641 --> 07:02.920
Ahh, Onii-chan!

07:06.720 --> 07:07.720
Oji-san?

07:07.721 --> 07:08.910
Yuuta!

07:12.110 --> 07:14.110
MIU-CHAN'S
FASHION LESSON

07:12.110 --> 07:14.110
EPISODE NO. 7522

07:12.800 --> 07:15.460
Miu-chan's fashion lesson!

07:14.111 --> 07:16.110
A

07:16.110 --> 07:20.029
Huh? Is that the famous
Yumaiya Yu-cake from Shiina?

07:20.030 --> 07:21.079
It is!

07:21.080 --> 07:26.219
People wait in long lines and put in six-
month reservations for these cakes!

07:26.220 --> 07:28.619
Wow! I want to see it now!

07:28.620 --> 07:29.939
Where's everyone else?

07:29.940 --> 07:34.849
Oji-san's at school. Onee-chan
and Hina will be out until evening.

07:34.850 --> 07:37.169
Then why don't the two of us eat it?

07:37.170 --> 07:39.580
I wonder what kind you got!

07:40.420 --> 07:43.280
It's a whole Gateau Fraise cake.

07:43.850 --> 07:45.809
It's so lovely!

07:45.810 --> 07:46.730
I know!

07:46.731 --> 07:49.390
I want to eat the stuff in the middle-

07:52.570 --> 07:54.169
I'm sorry!

07:54.170 --> 07:55.979
I'll clean you up.

07:55.980 --> 07:57.189
Stay put while I...

07:57.190 --> 07:58.989
Actually...

07:58.990 --> 08:00.280
M-Miu-chan?

08:01.420 --> 08:04.379
It was too much of a shame
to let it go to waste!

08:04.380 --> 08:07.289
Ooh, it's soo yummy!

08:07.290 --> 08:09.459
Th-That's great, Miu-chan.

08:09.460 --> 08:11.610
I can't forget about you...

08:16.810 --> 08:17.810
Sorry!

08:17.811 --> 08:19.469
It's okay.

08:19.470 --> 08:21.150
Time for seconds!

08:22.780 --> 08:26.060
I hope it'll be ready by this Sunday.

08:29.060 --> 08:31.149
Huh? Where's the cake?

08:31.150 --> 08:33.139
We're only here to order it.

08:33.140 --> 08:37.070
It's a very special cake, so
we'll have to wait to eat it.

08:41.240 --> 08:43.619
I didn't even get <i>that</i> dirty.

08:43.620 --> 08:47.289
I'm really sorry I ruined
your expensive cake.

08:47.290 --> 08:48.999
Don't worry about it.

08:49.000 --> 08:50.459
Did you like it?

08:50.460 --> 08:51.540
Sure did!

08:52.470 --> 08:53.960
Now it's your turn.

08:56.880 --> 08:58.310
Okay, turn around.

08:59.240 --> 09:00.690
Go ahead!

09:02.300 --> 09:06.490
Shiori-san, you have a great
body, and nice breasts too.

09:08.030 --> 09:10.119
I don't think it's anything special.

09:10.120 --> 09:11.120
Allow me...

09:12.280 --> 09:13.629
What are you...

09:13.630 --> 09:18.780
If you press them together, that cleavage
will attract a lot of guys' stares.

09:18.800 --> 09:21.099
I-I'll pass, thank you!

09:21.100 --> 09:23.389
I know I shouldn't say
this to an older woman,

09:23.390 --> 09:25.869
but you're really cute, Shiori-san!

09:25.870 --> 09:27.399
Don't make fun of me!

09:27.400 --> 09:29.559
I'm not, honest!

09:29.560 --> 09:31.309
You must attract a lot of guys.

09:31.310 --> 09:33.909
Of course not! Not even one!

09:33.910 --> 09:36.729
Besides, it's not like I want to anyway.

09:36.730 --> 09:39.999
You may not want to
attract a bunch of guys,

09:40.000 --> 09:43.000
but you do want to
attract at least one, right?

09:43.690 --> 09:45.220
Now look...

09:45.630 --> 09:47.129
But still,

09:47.130 --> 09:51.559
your casual wear won't exactly
make you stand out, Shiori-san.

09:51.560 --> 09:52.929
You think so?

09:52.930 --> 09:54.440
I know!

09:58.440 --> 09:59.440
How about we...

10:02.000 --> 10:06.170
try out a bunch of looks while
your clothes are in the wash?

10:12.480 --> 10:15.369
Miu-chan, why am I blindfolded?

10:15.370 --> 10:19.799
It'll make a bigger impact if you
see yourself after you put them on.

10:19.800 --> 10:22.020
I guess you're right, but...

10:22.560 --> 10:24.880
Let's try out your first look!

10:31.270 --> 10:32.919
Please hurry.

10:32.920 --> 10:36.069
First we'll make you
look a little more mature...

10:36.070 --> 10:38.980
With these! Ooh, Yuri-san, so risqué!

10:42.070 --> 10:43.489
Here we go!

10:43.490 --> 10:45.179
Tada!

10:45.180 --> 10:46.539
Whoa!

10:46.540 --> 10:48.360
Is this really me?

10:49.490 --> 10:50.649
Do you like it?

10:50.650 --> 10:51.999
I do!

10:52.000 --> 10:53.000
I think.

10:53.001 --> 10:55.079
Let's take it a little bit further!

10:55.080 --> 10:56.549
We're still doing this?

10:56.550 --> 10:58.489
Of course we are!

10:58.490 --> 11:01.329
Next up is this! Tada!

11:01.330 --> 11:04.549
Wait, this is embarrassing!

11:04.550 --> 11:08.619
But Shiori-san, you're always
acting the part of a strict class rep.

11:08.620 --> 11:12.079
If you take a commanding pose
while wearing this, it'll never get old!

11:12.080 --> 11:14.019
Y-You think so?

11:14.020 --> 11:17.520
Just go ahead and try
acting like a class rep!

11:20.170 --> 11:22.159
Hey, boys!

11:22.160 --> 11:24.029
That felt kind of good!

11:24.030 --> 11:25.030
What did I tell you?

11:25.031 --> 11:26.299
Now then,

11:26.300 --> 11:27.860
let's cover up those eyes again!

11:29.950 --> 11:32.140
I wonder what will work?

11:32.810 --> 11:35.719
Oh my god! We <i>gotta</i> go with this!

11:35.720 --> 11:37.759
Huh? What is it?

11:37.760 --> 11:40.159
Relax, don't worry!

11:40.160 --> 11:41.880
Then why are you giggling?

11:42.130 --> 11:43.850
Here we go.

11:42.630 --> 11:43.630
- SEG
- AWA

11:43.850 --> 11:44.870
No way!

11:44.870 --> 11:47.990
I sort of get what you're
going for, but this is too small!

11:46.170 --> 11:46.210
- SEG
- AWA

11:48.013 --> 11:50.860
Yuri-san wore this in middle school.

11:50.860 --> 11:54.390
But seeing you wear it makes
you look like Segawa Shiori-san!

11:57.900 --> 12:00.400
Segawa Shiori?

12:02.670 --> 12:07.099
Yes, you're no longer Kitahara
Shiori, you're Segawa Shiori.

12:07.100 --> 12:08.699
Y-Yuuta-san?

12:08.700 --> 12:10.409
Does that mean we're...

12:10.410 --> 12:12.099
Yes, married.

12:12.100 --> 12:14.280
And now we're going to
consummate our union.

12:17.870 --> 12:19.549
Um...

12:19.550 --> 12:23.210
If that's the case, then why
are we wearing swimsuits?

12:23.670 --> 12:25.499
That's what I'm into.

12:25.500 --> 12:27.709
He is, Shiori-san.

12:27.710 --> 12:29.919
Let's all consummate our love!

12:29.920 --> 12:32.150
Huh? "Our" love?

12:33.070 --> 12:37.720
Don't you get it? We all share Onii-chan.

12:39.200 --> 12:40.999
He's Hina's too!

12:41.000 --> 12:42.000
Hina!

12:43.520 --> 12:44.520
Hina?

12:45.320 --> 12:48.739
She may be in middle school,
but Hina's up for anything!

12:48.740 --> 12:50.669
You're all so cute!

12:50.670 --> 12:53.739
All right. Come right here, girls!

12:53.740 --> 12:55.160
Okay!

12:56.740 --> 12:59.340
No! No! Nooo!

13:00.200 --> 13:01.749
S-Sorry!

13:01.750 --> 13:03.900
Don't you like it?

13:12.720 --> 13:13.720
No, wait!

13:14.300 --> 13:16.920
I only said "no" because, well...

13:17.650 --> 13:18.999
You're wrong!

13:19.000 --> 13:22.519
You're so cute when you're embarrassed!

13:22.520 --> 13:24.899
Gosh, Miu-chan!

13:24.900 --> 13:27.190
I wonder if I'll get to wear a dress,

13:27.520 --> 13:29.549
like this one.

13:29.550 --> 13:31.189
You will!

13:31.190 --> 13:37.449
I'm sure you'll find a wonderful guy, and
maybe wear a dress you designed yourself.

13:37.450 --> 13:40.519
Oh, great idea! I'll do that!

13:40.520 --> 13:43.019
Then make one for me too.

13:43.020 --> 13:45.519
I'll accept that order!

13:45.520 --> 13:47.839
Ooh, you're such a cutie!

13:47.840 --> 13:50.600
Now it's your turn!

13:51.870 --> 13:53.969
Come on, stay still!

13:53.970 --> 13:54.840
Hey!

13:54.840 --> 13:55.840
There!

14:01.150 --> 14:02.919
I'm back!

14:02.920 --> 14:04.399
I came to visit!

14:04.400 --> 14:06.149
Oh, good evening.

14:06.150 --> 14:07.799
Come join us, Onii-chan.

14:07.800 --> 14:08.990
Sure, glad to.

14:18.030 --> 14:22.370
Wow, what's this? It's amazing!

14:25.620 --> 14:29.799
When it comes to how they wear their
yukatas, I think Shiori-san has the lead.

14:29.800 --> 14:34.090
But I'll bet Onee-chan will
rival her in about two years.

14:35.170 --> 14:37.820
I wonder where we'll be in 10 years?

14:39.300 --> 14:41.200
I so can't wait.

14:43.100 --> 14:45.100
HINA-CHAN
GOES ALL
BY HERSELF

14:43.100 --> 14:45.100
EPISODE NO. 7523

14:43.620 --> 14:45.720
Hina-chan goes all by herself!

14:45.101 --> 14:47.100
A

14:54.270 --> 14:56.099
It's raining, Usa-tan!

14:56.100 --> 14:59.780
But don't worry, it'll be
sunny when we get there.

15:00.120 --> 15:01.670
I'm going.

15:27.700 --> 15:29.720
Hina, wake u-

15:30.120 --> 15:31.120
Huh?

15:34.000 --> 15:35.400
Hina?

15:39.870 --> 15:41.499
That scared me.

15:41.500 --> 15:44.499
But we're safe. Let's go!

15:44.500 --> 15:45.549
Did you find her?

15:45.550 --> 15:46.949
No!

15:46.950 --> 15:49.599
No luck at the station either.

15:49.600 --> 15:52.339
I looked around the park several times.

15:52.340 --> 15:54.549
Where did she go?

15:54.550 --> 15:55.800
I hope...

15:57.300 --> 15:58.220
Hello?

15:58.221 --> 15:59.405
KARAOKE HALL

15:58.600 --> 16:00.589
I was about to head
home after my night job,

16:00.590 --> 16:04.049
but I ran into Sako-senpai
who was karaokeing by himself.

16:04.050 --> 16:05.600
Are you free today?

16:06.120 --> 16:07.729
Sorry, I'm actually...

16:07.730 --> 16:09.419
Whaat?!

16:09.420 --> 16:12.310
Segawa-kun, can we be of service?

16:24.520 --> 16:26.490
Um... Um...

16:27.920 --> 16:29.749
Where should we go?

16:29.750 --> 16:32.959
Let's see...

16:32.960 --> 16:33.969
<i>Hmm?</i>

16:33.970 --> 16:36.970
<i>It should take you ten minutes
by subway from the station.</i>

16:38.100 --> 16:42.419
<i>If you turn right at the road along the
bento shop then keep going straight,</i>

16:42.420 --> 16:44.169
<i>you can even walk there.</i>

16:44.170 --> 16:45.300
<i>Oh!</i>

16:45.770 --> 16:49.330
<i>But who'd want to walk there?</i>

16:49.750 --> 16:51.449
She said turn right!

16:51.450 --> 16:53.500
But which way is right?

16:54.170 --> 16:55.730
I'll go this way!

16:57.670 --> 16:58.779
I still can't find her!

16:58.780 --> 17:00.769
Where else can we look?

17:00.770 --> 17:02.649
Why would she do this?

17:02.650 --> 17:05.119
And today of all days?

17:05.120 --> 17:10.290
Let's keep looking. If we still
can't find her, we'll get the police.

17:17.170 --> 17:19.800
It's stopped raining! It's stopped raining!

17:19.820 --> 17:21.970
It's stopped raining!

17:26.120 --> 17:30.619
Usa-tan, they said that it's
always sunny above the clouds!

17:30.620 --> 17:31.930
Isn't it magical?

17:32.570 --> 17:33.850
Look!

17:40.320 --> 17:42.320
Rainbows are pretty!

17:47.620 --> 17:49.120
Wow!

18:03.900 --> 18:06.150
Hina-chan!

18:09.550 --> 18:10.720
Hina-chan!

18:13.250 --> 18:14.950
Shiori-neetan?

18:17.400 --> 18:19.169
Hina-chan, are you by yourself?

18:19.170 --> 18:20.070
Mm-hmm!

18:20.071 --> 18:22.319
Hina's going to the Ferris wheel!

18:22.320 --> 18:23.469
Ferris wheel?

18:23.470 --> 18:25.240
Yup! At Eggtown!

18:25.650 --> 18:27.869
Eggtown? At Korakuen?

18:27.870 --> 18:29.870
Yeah! You got it!

18:30.350 --> 18:32.000
I have to go there!

18:33.620 --> 18:35.620
Bye, Shiori-tan!

18:38.400 --> 18:39.870
You're going the wrong way!

18:40.880 --> 18:43.880
I'll go there with you.

18:44.970 --> 18:47.199
Really? Thanks a lot, Shiori-chan!

18:47.200 --> 18:48.259
You're welcome!

18:48.260 --> 18:53.600
Um, she said wanted to go somewhere
today, but you told her she can't.

18:55.520 --> 18:59.319
If you're all busy, I'll go with her.

18:59.320 --> 19:00.520
No, you're wrong.

19:01.600 --> 19:06.219
Today's my sister's...
her mother's birthday.

19:06.220 --> 19:10.620
We were going to bring a cake to her grave.

19:11.240 --> 19:15.750
But I wasn't sure if Hina would
understand what we're doing.

19:16.150 --> 19:18.069
Is that so?

19:18.070 --> 19:19.669
I'm sorry.

19:19.670 --> 19:23.500
I promised to take her to the amusement
park without knowing about this.

19:24.170 --> 19:26.349
Hina-chan looks like she's done eating.

19:26.350 --> 19:29.970
I'll take her only to the Ferris
wheel then bring her home.

19:32.270 --> 19:33.669
I'm done!

19:33.670 --> 19:35.419
The onigiri was yummy!

19:35.420 --> 19:36.700
Really?

19:41.820 --> 19:43.069
Let's go.

19:43.070 --> 19:44.250
Yeah!

19:51.470 --> 19:53.120
It's the Ferris wheel!

19:53.490 --> 19:56.120
Hina-chan! Don't run!

20:02.170 --> 20:05.069
It looks like a long line.
But you can wait, right?

20:05.070 --> 20:06.070
Yup!

20:06.900 --> 20:08.370
We're almost there.

20:09.050 --> 20:10.070
Hina!

20:10.590 --> 20:11.570
Oi-tan?

20:11.571 --> 20:13.849
Sora-neetan? Miu-neetan?

20:13.850 --> 20:14.869
Hina!

20:14.870 --> 20:17.140
Why did you leave the
house without telling us?

20:18.300 --> 20:20.140
We were worried sick about you!

20:21.310 --> 20:22.810
W-Wait!

20:26.620 --> 20:27.780
Are you sorry?

20:30.670 --> 20:32.600
Did you want to ride it that much?

20:35.670 --> 20:37.289
Fine.

20:37.290 --> 20:40.799
Why don't we ride it together?

20:40.800 --> 20:44.380
But we can't cut in line, so
we'll have to go to the back again.

20:45.850 --> 20:47.050
Are you okay with that?

20:52.750 --> 20:54.389
I'm sorry!

20:58.890 --> 21:00.390
NEED
ESCORTS

20:58.890 --> 21:00.390
AND
BELOW

20:58.890 --> 21:00.390
WARNING

20:58.890 --> 21:01.890
- MUST BE ACCOMPANIED BY AN ESCORT WHO IS MIDDLE-SCHOOL
AGED OR OLDER - WE WILL NOT SERVE THE FOLLOWING CUSTOMERS:

20:58.890 --> 21:01.890
INTOXICATED.

21:00.391 --> 21:01.890
AGES
SEVEN

21:00.391 --> 21:01.890
AGES

21:00.391 --> 21:01.890
ALL CHILDREN SEVEN OR UNDER

21:21.770 --> 21:24.919
It's been so long since
I've been on a Ferris wheel!

21:24.920 --> 21:27.420
I haven't been on one in years.

21:27.770 --> 21:30.420
Wow! I can see the Sky Tree!

21:31.870 --> 21:34.430
I wonder where the Tokyo Tower is.

21:35.150 --> 21:37.170
You're pretty quiet, Hina-chan.

21:40.200 --> 21:43.319
Today is Mommy's birthday.

21:43.320 --> 21:46.300
I'm going to show her my picture!

21:47.020 --> 21:48.190
Hina...

21:49.250 --> 21:54.200
Since you're in heaven, Mommy,
Hina came to you in the sky!

21:56.000 --> 21:57.020
Hina.

22:02.070 --> 22:05.470
Mommy, happy birthday! Hina's doing great!

22:06.100 --> 22:07.100
Hina.

22:07.320 --> 22:10.210
Huh? What's wrong, Oi-tan?

22:15.020 --> 22:18.219
Hey, let's say it together, Onii-chan!

22:18.220 --> 22:19.550
Good idea.

22:20.890 --> 22:22.649
Yay!

22:22.650 --> 22:24.119
Why don't you come here?

22:24.120 --> 22:25.100
Thanks.

22:25.101 --> 22:27.650
Hey, come here, Onee-chan!

22:28.420 --> 22:30.270
Are we ready?

22:31.230 --> 22:32.450
- Nee-san!
- Mommy!

22:31.230 --> 22:32.450
- Yuri-san!
- Yuri-san!

22:32.453 --> 22:35.030
Happy birthday!

22:44.220 --> 22:47.969
Nee-san, are you watching over us?

22:47.970 --> 22:50.549
I've always seen Hina as this little kid,

22:50.550 --> 22:53.169
but she's really got a good heart.

22:53.170 --> 22:55.270
I hope you're happy for us.

22:56.000 --> 23:00.370
I will watch over these girls
until they're grown up.

23:02.620 --> 23:03.850
Yes.

23:04.470 --> 23:06.810
Until they all walk down the aisle.

23:10.300 --> 23:12.550
I'll give my all for them.

23:20.320 --> 23:20.370
- SEA ANGEL EXHIBIT
- SEA ANGEL EXHIBIT

23:22.833 --> 23:25.330
I wanted to ride with her.

23:27.070 --> 23:28.420
With Hina-chan.

23:31.020 --> 23:33.249
Why do we have an emergency train stoppage?

23:33.250 --> 23:39.169
By now I should be on the Ferris
wheel with Hina-sama, my little fairy!

23:39.170 --> 23:40.339
Whoa there.

23:40.340 --> 23:42.849
With my little fairy!

23:42.850 --> 23:44.470
Senpai!

23:54.570 --> 23:58.559
My sweet love sparkles bright.

23:58.560 --> 24:02.379
Will my love come true?

24:02.380 --> 24:06.649
What's the color of my brimming love?

24:06.650 --> 24:10.809
Should I show a little bit of it?

24:10.810 --> 24:14.869
Just a little moment of excitement.

24:14.870 --> 24:18.939
You can see a little color coming through.

24:18.940 --> 24:23.209
My little world is shaken.

24:23.210 --> 24:27.209
But it's being gently calmed down.

24:27.210 --> 24:31.479
Your colors are too mischievous.

24:31.480 --> 24:35.419
They are spinning crazily inside me.

24:35.420 --> 24:39.479
Your colors are twisting and turning.

24:39.480 --> 24:43.329
Now they're flying past
like a shaken soda bottle.

24:43.330 --> 24:47.689
I love your colors, I
wonder if you're feeling me?

24:47.690 --> 24:51.849
Staying in your love, your
sweet and sparkly love.

24:51.850 --> 24:55.919
Your colors are twisting and turning.

24:55.920 --> 24:59.589
Will the soft strawberry
milk soar high in the air?

24:59.590 --> 25:03.919
I love your colors, I wonder
what they're drawing?

25:03.920 --> 25:08.210
Staying in your love, your
sweet and sparkly love.
